stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Drafted: User writes in Notion

    Drafted --> Parsed: GarminMD reads Notion page
    Parsed --> Resolved: Exercise names mapped to Garmin types
    Resolved --> Pushed: Uploaded to Garmin Connect

    Pushed --> OnWatch: User syncs watch
    OnWatch --> InProgress: User starts workout
    InProgress --> Completed: User finishes workout

    Completed --> Synced: Watch syncs to Garmin Connect
    Synced --> Pulled: GarminMD detects new activity
    Pulled --> Matched: Activity matched to plan
    Matched --> Analyzed: LLM compares plan vs actual

    Analyzed --> [*]: Insight shown on dashboard

    Pushed --> Updated: Notion page changed
    Updated --> Parsed: Re-sync triggered

    note right of Drafted
        Lives in Notion
        User's training page
    end note

    note right of Pushed
        Idempotent re-upload
        Matched by name
    end note

    note right of Analyzed
        Auto-insight: immediate
        Deep analysis: on demand
    end note
